    "text": "A fun prompt for visualizing sport GOATs with GPT.\n\nPrompt: 2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 sport goats that passed away:\n\nINPUT ::= [PUBLIC_FIGURE]\n\nDOMAIN            ::= infer(primary_field(PUBLIC_FIGURE))\nERA               ::= infer(defining_era(PUBLIC_FIGURE))\nHERO_PORTRAIT     ::= infer(most_iconic_mature_visual_state(PUBLIC_FIGURE))\nCAREER_MOMENTS    ::= infer(3..6 defining_visual_moments(PUBLIC_FIGURE))\nACHIEVEMENTS      ::= infer(4..7 highest_signal_accomplishments(PUBLIC_FIGURE))\nQUOTE             ::= infer(short authentic_or_theme-appropriate_legacy_statement)\nSIGNATURE_MARK    ::= infer(signature | monogram | number | symbol | emblem)\nMYTHIC_SYMBOL     ::= infer(animal | object | motif | force strongly associated_with(PUBLIC_FIGURE))\nCOLOR_DNA         ::= infer(signature_palette_from_identity_domain_and_era)\n\nCANVAS ::= cinematic_horizontal_tribute_poster\n\nCOMPOSITION ::=\n\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ NAME / TITLE                           HERO PORTRAIT             LEGACY TEXT │\n│ large editorial serif                 monumental close-up       + signature │\n│                                                                              │\n│ ACHIEVEMENTS       MYTHIC_SYMBOL wrapping through portrait                    │\n│                    ↘                                                         │\n│         smaller CAREER_MOMENTS layered across lower center                   │\n│                                                                              │\n│                    dark cinematic atmospheric background                     │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\nRULES ::=\n- HERO_PORTRAIT dominates frame and establishes immediate recognition\n- smaller CAREER_MOMENTS show different phases, poses, costumes, or roles\n- MYTHIC_SYMBOL must weave through the collage, not sit separately\n- symbol should embody reputation, mentality, nickname, style, or mythology\n- hierarchy: face > name > symbolic motif > career moments > achievements > quote\n- use dramatic metallic highlights over deep shadow\n- blend photography/illustration through smoke, texture, grain, and painted transitions\n- typography feels commemorative, premium, archival, legendary\n- infer all achievements, symbols, numbers, colors, quotes, and supporting scenes\n- no hard-coded person-specific details",
